                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "For everyone in the EU i can't recommend this game. \nThe only existing server is in the US (or maybe asia) and every EU player has a super shity ping there (red bars everywhere). Everyone in pvp is just spaming his normal attack or trying to hit the one hit ultimate because hitting specials, a grapple or dodging is extremly random because of this ...\n\nWhich honestly is kinda sad, i like the style of the game and that you can also do PvE (only a limited time however, mobile style ...). \nMost items (That i have seen after 3 hours of play) seem to have a time limit (even the items you get after a class change) as long as you dont pay with real money currency, which is also very mobile style ...\n\nThey also did not bother to reset after the closed beta, which means a lot of high level guys are already in the game which is also lame.",
